@startuml state-payment
!include style.iuml
title Статусы платежа (PaymentStateMachine)
hide empty description

[*] --> CREATED : POST /payments\n(новый Idempotency-Key)
CREATED --> CLIENT_VERIFIED : клиент и кошелёк найдены
CLIENT_VERIFIED --> CLIENT_DATA_RECEIVED : ABC вернул ACTIVE
CLIENT_DATA_RECEIVED --> BALANCE_CHECKED : balance ≥ amount + fee
BALANCE_CHECKED --> PENDING : транзакция отправлена
PENDING --> CONFIRMED : receipt, status = 1

CREATED --> FAILED : CLIENT_NOT_FOUND\nWALLET_NOT_FOUND
CLIENT_VERIFIED --> FAILED : CLIENT_BLOCKED\nCLIENT_DATA_UNAVAILABLE
CLIENT_DATA_RECEIVED --> FAILED : INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS
BALANCE_CHECKED --> FAILED : BLOCKCHAIN_ERROR\n(узел отклонил)
PENDING --> FAILED : reverted (BLOCKCHAIN_ERROR)\nили CONFIRMATION_TIMEOUT

CONFIRMED --> PARTIALLY_REFUNDED : возврат COMPLETED,\nвозвращено < суммы
CONFIRMED --> REFUNDED : возврат COMPLETED,\nвозвращено = сумме
PARTIALLY_REFUNDED --> PARTIALLY_REFUNDED : ещё один\nчастичный возврат
PARTIALLY_REFUNDED --> REFUNDED : возвращено = сумме

FAILED --> [*]
REFUNDED --> [*]

note right of PENDING
  Каждый переход пишется в payment_status_history
  в одной транзакции БД с изменением платежа.
  Недопустимый переход → INVALID_STATE.
end note
@enduml
